<h2 id="_3">五、实践案例</h2>
<h3 id="51-1">5.1 案例1：实时语音助手</h3>
<p><strong>需求</strong>：Jetson Orin NX上部署TTS，延迟&lt;500ms</p>
<p><strong>方案</strong>：</p>
<pre><code>F5-TTS (TensorRT FP16) + 流式生成
- 首字延迟：350ms
- 完整句子：800ms
- 内存占用：1.2GB
</code></pre>
<p><strong>代码</strong>：</p>
<pre><code class="language-python">from f5_tts.infer import F5TTS
import numpy as np

class RealtimeTTS:
    def __init__(self):
        self.model = F5TTS.from_pretrained(&quot;SWivid/F5-TTS&quot;)
        self.model.to(&quot;cuda&quot;)

    def stream_infer(self, text_chunk, callback):
        &quot;&quot;&quot;流式推理，边生成边回调&quot;&quot;&quot;
        audio = self.model.infer(text=text_chunk, stream=True)
        for chunk in audio:
            callback(chunk)  # 实时播放

# 使用
tts = RealtimeTTS()
tts.stream_infer(&quot;你好，这是一个&quot;, callback=play_audio)
</code></pre>
